WEBVTT



2
00:40.083 --> 00:44.250
SOUTH HULU SUNGAI, 2016

3
00:49.541 --> 00:53.083
Sleep

4
00:54.000 --> 00:56.375
My child

5
00:56.458 --> 00:59.541
Honey, sleep

6
01:02.333 --> 01:05.666
Your eyes look sleepy

7
01:06.875 --> 01:10.625
Go to bed

8
01:13.625 --> 01:17.791
Go to sleep quickly

9
01:17.875 --> 01:21.375
My dear

10
03:37.666 --> 03:39.250
Kuyang!

11
03:40.250 --> 03:41.416
There's a kuyang!

12
03:41.500 --> 03:45.500
Help!

13
03:45.583 --> 03:47.500
Kuyang!

14
04:22.000 --> 04:23.291
There, there.

15
04:24.166 --> 04:26.583
Don't cry for your poor mother.

16
04:29.125 --> 04:31.250
Her soul won't be at peace.

17
04:32.208 --> 04:37.750
There is no god but Allah alone, without partner.

18
04:38.416 --> 04:42.416
To Him belongs the dominion and to Him belongs the praise,

19
04:42.500 --> 04:46.583
and He is over all things capable.

20
04:49.666 --> 04:51.833
- Thank you, Ustaz. - You're welcome.

21
04:51.916 --> 04:53.875
- Thank you for coming. - Yes.

22
04:55.791 --> 04:58.833
- It's my duty. - Ustaz.

23
04:58.916 --> 05:00.083
- What's this? - For you.

24
05:00.166 --> 05:03.083
- There's no need. - It's okay. It's already prepared.

25
05:03.166 --> 05:05.166
- Okay, I accept. - This too.

26
05:05.250 --> 05:07.583
Goodness, thank you.

27
05:07.666 --> 05:09.750
- You're welcome. - Thank you very much, Chief.

28
05:09.833 --> 05:11.083
Thank you, Ustaz.

29
05:11.166 --> 05:13.125
- I'll take my leave. - Yes, take care.

30
05:13.208 --> 05:15.791
- Peace be upon you. - Peace be upon you too.

31
05:16.916 --> 05:18.833
Who are you waiting for?

32
05:20.083 --> 05:21.500
Well…

33
05:21.583 --> 05:23.458
Do you have anything left for me?

34
05:24.666 --> 05:27.125
- Get some for him. - Okay.

35
05:30.375 --> 05:31.750
You see, Utuh Ampong.

36
05:31.833 --> 05:34.000
Whenever I go out,

37
05:34.083 --> 05:36.833
my wife often asks me what I'll bring home.

38
05:38.083 --> 05:39.958
You're funny.

39
05:40.041 --> 05:42.375
- Chief. - Yes?

40
05:42.458 --> 05:44.208
I'll leave my house with you.

41
05:44.291 --> 05:48.083
I'm going back to Siang Gantung in a few days.

42
05:48.166 --> 05:50.541
No worries, I'll look after it.

43
05:50.625 --> 05:52.125
- Thank you, Chief. - Not at all.

44
05:52.208 --> 05:54.541
Here you go. For your wife.

45
05:54.625 --> 05:57.125
I hope she'll love you even more.

46
05:57.208 --> 05:59.333
Gosh, it's such a hassle.

47
05:59.416 --> 06:02.875
But what can I do?

48
06:04.333 --> 06:06.416
I'll take my leave now. Thank you so much.

49
06:06.500 --> 06:08.333
- Yes. - You're welcome.

50
06:08.416 --> 06:11.916
- Peace be upon you. - Peace be upon you too.

51
06:12.000 --> 06:13.250
Peace be upon you.

52
06:13.333 --> 06:15.375
- Peace be upon you too. - Peace be upon you too.

53
06:19.708 --> 06:21.333
Enjoy the drink.

54
06:21.416 --> 06:23.125
I'll be right back.

55
06:24.750 --> 06:25.916
Auntie, look.

56
06:26.666 --> 06:28.250
That's Rusmiati.

57
06:29.041 --> 06:30.916
Was that Rusmiati?

58
06:31.000 --> 06:34.791
Yes, she's my little sister, Irus. Why?

59
06:34.875 --> 06:37.333
We came a long way from Kandangan

60
06:37.416 --> 06:39.750
as representatives of the Haji Alamsyah family,

61
06:39.833 --> 06:41.375
the owner of Niena Gold Shop.

62
06:41.458 --> 06:43.791
Oh, Niena Gold Shop.

63
06:43.875 --> 06:46.041
I always go there to buy my gold.

64
06:46.125 --> 06:49.125
How can I help you ladies tonight?

65
06:49.208 --> 06:52.458
We came to convey the wishes of our son, Badri.

66
06:52.541 --> 06:54.208
Has the boat been tied up yet?

67
06:54.291 --> 06:55.958
Whose boat?

68
06:56.708 --> 07:00.208
They mean Rusmiati's boat.

69
07:00.291 --> 07:03.083
I tied Rusmiati's boat earlier this evening.

70
07:04.250 --> 07:07.166
So you're saying you came all the way here

71
07:07.250 --> 07:08.666
to buy Rusmiati's boat?

72
07:08.750 --> 07:12.541
- Hey. - Rusmiati's boat is not for sale.

73
07:12.625 --> 07:15.250
Why are we talking about boats?

74
07:15.333 --> 07:17.333
Please let me clarify.

75
07:17.416 --> 07:19.208
My aunt means,

76
07:19.291 --> 07:22.916
Rusmiati doesn't have ties to any other men, right?

77
07:23.708 --> 07:28.416
Because we're here to propose to Rusmiati

78
07:28.500 --> 07:30.375
on behalf of my older brother, Badri.

79
07:30.458 --> 07:33.875
If that's the case, then I understand.

80
07:33.958 --> 07:35.916
I thought

81
07:36.000 --> 07:39.583
you really wanted to buy Rusmiati's boat.

82
07:40.625 --> 07:42.958
You finally understood.

83
07:47.625 --> 07:49.750
Excuse me, can I have a drink?

84
07:49.833 --> 07:50.750
Sure.

85
07:52.375 --> 07:55.041
- Let's just trade, okay? - Yeah, okay.

86
08:01.208 --> 08:04.083
BADRI, A CREW MEMBER AND TEAM LEADER OF TEAM BANJARMASIN

87
08:04.166 --> 08:05.875
Good luck, Team Banjarmasin!

88
08:13.750 --> 08:15.791
Dear viewers, we're now witnessing

89
08:15.875 --> 08:18.500
the finale of the Mayor's Cup Dragon Boat Race.

90
08:18.583 --> 08:21.833
Can Team Banjarmasin win this year's competition?

91
08:21.916 --> 08:23.208
HENDRA BELIEVED TO HAVE GONE TO THE MYSTICAL CITY OF SARANJANA

92
08:23.291 --> 08:26.666
It seems like this final match will be very competitive.

93
08:27.541 --> 08:30.791
And Banjarmasin is falling behind.

94
08:33.083 --> 08:37.125
- Banjarmasin! - Banjarmasin!

95
08:37.208 --> 08:40.125
- Banjarmasin! - Banjarmasin!

96
08:40.208 --> 08:45.375
- Banjarmasin! - Banjarmasin!

97
08:45.458 --> 08:49.625
- Banjarmasin! - Banjarmasin!

98
08:49.708 --> 08:55.208
- Banjarmasin! - Banjarmasin!

99
08:55.291 --> 09:00.541
- Banjarmasin! - Banjarmasin!

100
09:00.625 --> 09:06.083
- Banjarmasin! - Banjarmasin!

101
09:06.166 --> 09:12.833
- Banjarmasin! - Banjarmasin!

102
09:12.916 --> 09:15.208
- Banjarmasin! - Banjarmasin!

103
09:15.291 --> 09:19.208
Team Banjarmasin was able to overtake! Just a little bit more!

104
09:19.291 --> 09:20.708
Just a little more and…

105
09:20.791 --> 09:23.125
Team Banjarmasin wins!

106
09:34.541 --> 09:35.750
Rus?

107
09:35.833 --> 09:38.083
Why are you leaning against the wall like that?

108
09:38.166 --> 09:41.208
There was a lizard earlier. I got rid of it.

109
09:41.291 --> 09:45.000
- Oh, don't worry about it. - There was a lizard.

110
09:45.083 --> 09:48.083
Do you know the son of the owner of Niena Gold Shop?

111
09:48.666 --> 09:51.208
His name is Badri.

112
09:51.291 --> 09:53.833
His family is here to propose to you.

113
09:53.916 --> 09:55.208
- Badri? - Yes.

114
09:55.291 --> 09:56.916
I know him.

115
09:57.000 --> 09:58.500
Great.

116
09:58.583 --> 10:00.750
So what do you think? Do you accept?

117
10:02.541 --> 10:05.000
Why aren't you answering?

118
10:05.083 --> 10:07.666
Hurry, they're waiting for your answer.

119
10:16.458 --> 10:18.291
What is Rusmiati's answer?

120
10:22.125 --> 10:23.000
She said yes.

121
10:23.083 --> 10:26.208
- Praise be to God. - Praise be to God.

122
10:38.625 --> 10:41.500
MAYOR'S CUP

123
11:03.416 --> 11:06.541
Badri, this is for you.

124
11:06.625 --> 11:07.791
Thank you.

125
11:12.000 --> 11:13.791
Iqbal, who's that?

126
11:13.875 --> 11:16.958
That's Rusmiati. She's from Nagara.

127
11:36.041 --> 11:37.041
Rus!

128
11:40.250 --> 11:41.708
One more thing.

129
11:41.791 --> 11:43.250
Regarding the dowry,

130
11:43.333 --> 11:45.833
Badri's family agreed to 25 million rupiah.

131
11:45.916 --> 11:48.375
What do you think? Is it okay?

132
11:49.833 --> 11:51.416
It's up to you.

133
11:51.500 --> 11:53.625
Twenty-five million rupiah is okay.

134
12:01.875 --> 12:04.250
So does Rusmiati agree?

135
12:11.625 --> 12:13.875
She agrees.

136
12:13.958 --> 12:16.958
- Praise be to God. - Praise be to God.

137
12:17.041 --> 12:19.625
- But… - But what?

138
12:19.708 --> 12:21.291
Well…

139
12:21.375 --> 12:22.916
She asked for one more thing.

140
12:23.000 --> 12:25.416
A 25-gram gold bracelet.

141
12:26.625 --> 12:29.625
She asked for a 25-gram gold bracelet?

142
12:29.708 --> 12:32.541
Yes. Ask her yourself.

143
12:32.625 --> 12:36.583
She said it was up to me, so I asked for a 25-gram gold bracelet.

144
12:40.541 --> 12:43.333
After conveying Rusmiati's wishes,

145
12:43.416 --> 12:45.458
we, Badri's family, agree.

146
12:45.541 --> 12:49.083
It'll be a dowry of 25 million and a 25-gram gold bracelet.

147
12:49.166 --> 12:55.208
How about we hold the engagement party next week?

148
13:24.541 --> 13:26.083
Peace be upon you.

149
13:27.125 --> 13:30.041
- Peace be upon you too. - Peace be upon you.

150
13:30.125 --> 13:32.166
Enjoy your drink.

151
13:32.958 --> 13:35.958
What a coincidence that you came. I'm grilling snakehead fish.

152
13:38.000 --> 13:40.125
Thank you, Utuh Ampong.

153
13:40.208 --> 13:43.708
There's another victim who was bitten by a kuyang last night.

154
13:45.250 --> 13:48.458
He's had a fever for two days. Can you help him?

155
13:51.291 --> 13:54.041
- Do you have a guest right now? - Yes, they say there's a kuyang.

156
13:54.125 --> 13:55.875
Kuyang?

157
13:55.958 --> 14:00.458
It's black magic used to keep your husband in love with you and stay youthful.

158
14:02.041 --> 14:05.125
That's why people practice it.

159
14:06.166 --> 14:09.750
They suck the blood of children or women who have just given birth.

160
14:09.833 --> 14:13.166
Do people with that power still exist?

161
14:13.250 --> 14:14.916
I saw it myself.

162
14:15.000 --> 14:17.666
The kuyang flew through the window.

163
14:17.750 --> 14:19.666
My child was bitten.

164
14:20.750 --> 14:22.291
Let me see.

165
14:25.000 --> 14:26.875
It's not swollen anymore.

166
14:26.958 --> 14:29.916
Kuyang bites are no problem.

167
14:30.000 --> 14:32.875
At most, you'll get a slight fever. You'll get better.

168
14:32.958 --> 14:34.166
Are you sure he's okay?

169
14:49.958 --> 14:53.041
Bathe him and give him a little of this water to drink

170
14:53.125 --> 14:55.083
so he doesn't get sick.

171
14:55.166 --> 14:56.708
Utuh Ampong.

172
14:56.791 --> 15:00.458
This has happened twice in Siang Gantung Village.

173
15:00.541 --> 15:04.208
The villagers want the kuyang captured and killed if possible

174
15:04.291 --> 15:06.250
because it disturbs the people.

175
15:06.333 --> 15:09.166
Can you find out who the kuyang is?

176
15:09.250 --> 15:10.125
Here.

177
15:10.666 --> 15:13.666
I found this next to my baby.

178
15:18.625 --> 15:20.625
Utuh Ampong.

179
15:20.708 --> 15:24.000
Who knows? With your knowledge,

180
15:24.083 --> 15:27.458
we can find out who the kuyang is in our village.

181
15:27.541 --> 15:29.750
This is a bit challenging.

182
15:30.458 --> 15:34.958
That kuyang will definitely be careful about going out again.

183
15:35.625 --> 15:38.541
But I will try.

184
15:40.916 --> 15:43.291
Here, a little something from the villagers.

185
15:43.375 --> 15:45.125
Oh, no need.

186
15:45.208 --> 15:47.791
There's no need for money. Thank you.

187
15:47.875 --> 15:49.458
- Just accept it. - I'm all right.

188
15:49.541 --> 15:51.625
- Please accept it. - No.

189
15:51.708 --> 15:52.916
Maybe your wife needs it.

190
15:53.000 --> 15:55.583
I'm okay.

191
15:55.666 --> 15:57.333
The hell you are!

192
15:57.416 --> 16:01.083
Be patient. That's a sign your husband is kind.

193
16:01.166 --> 16:02.958
Too good to be human.

194
16:03.041 --> 16:05.208
So good that he'll become nothing.

195
16:09.583 --> 16:11.333
His name is Muhamad Hendra.

196
16:12.041 --> 16:13.791
Hendra is my cousin.

197
16:14.583 --> 16:18.916
He lives with his older sister in Kotabaru.

198
16:19.000 --> 16:20.416
Her name is Hamidah.

199
16:20.500 --> 16:22.208
Are you from Kotabaru?

200
16:22.291 --> 16:23.250
Yes.

201
16:24.458 --> 16:26.041
My name is Hamdan.

202
16:27.291 --> 16:30.375
I came here to look for Hendra.

203
16:30.458 --> 16:34.041
According to a psychic in Kotabaru,

204
16:34.833 --> 16:36.291
Hendra was taken to Saranjana.

205
16:37.375 --> 16:38.916
Saranjana?

206
16:39.000 --> 16:41.416
And the psychic said

207
16:41.500 --> 16:44.666
you have a sacred mandau knife inherited from your ancestors,

208
16:44.750 --> 16:47.541
which could be the key to entering Saranjana.

209
16:50.291 --> 16:52.666
Could you lend me that mandau?

210
16:52.750 --> 16:55.708
That information is not true.

211
16:55.791 --> 16:58.041
You'd better not believe it.

212
16:58.125 --> 17:00.041
A false story

213
17:00.125 --> 17:02.333
will bring disaster upon you.

214
17:02.416 --> 17:03.708
Have pity on Hamidah.

215
17:03.791 --> 17:06.625
She fell sick after losing Hendra.

216
17:06.708 --> 17:09.708
It's best not to continue the search.

217
17:09.791 --> 17:12.583
What happened was destined.

218
17:29.791 --> 17:31.166
Do you mean

219
17:32.125 --> 17:33.875
you want to cancel the engagement?

220
17:33.958 --> 17:36.291
No, it's not like that.

221
17:36.375 --> 17:40.541
My mom is still hung up on our marriage fortune.

222
17:41.083 --> 17:44.208
According to a psychic in Kandangan,

223
17:44.916 --> 17:48.250
our marriage is destined for misfortune.

224
17:48.875 --> 17:52.833
She insists that if we go through with it, our families will suffer many tragedies.

225
17:55.291 --> 17:59.125
Do you know a way to deal with the fortune?

226
18:01.250 --> 18:02.833
Do you?

227
18:02.916 --> 18:04.166
Don't worry.

228
18:04.791 --> 18:07.500
Just continue with your plans.

229
18:07.583 --> 18:10.458
God willing, everything will be fine.

230
18:13.708 --> 18:16.416
- Let's eat while the food is warm. - Yes.

231
18:25.083 --> 18:29.125
Are you sure you can remove the bad luck from their fortune?

232
18:31.083 --> 18:33.333
They love each other.

233
18:34.541 --> 18:37.833
Instead of scaring them about the future,

234
18:38.458 --> 18:42.625
we should help them when the time comes.

235
18:47.083 --> 18:49.000
I made a prediction too.

236
18:49.083 --> 18:51.666
I saw an ox in Badri's fortune.

237
18:53.208 --> 18:56.708
That means their married life will be prosperous.

238
18:56.791 --> 18:59.958
May the blessings they receive

239
19:00.041 --> 19:04.791
help them overcome the difficulties they may face in the future.

240
19:04.875 --> 19:08.125
An ox also means he's easy to control.

241
19:08.208 --> 19:09.666
That means

242
19:09.750 --> 19:14.625
Rusmiati will be able to rely on Badri's loyalty to her.

243
19:14.708 --> 19:16.041
Just like this oar,

244
19:17.583 --> 19:21.958
our love will be able to conquer any strong current that hits us.

245
19:23.750 --> 19:25.375
And with this oar,

246
19:26.583 --> 19:29.333
our boat will continue to sail to its destination.

247
19:30.541 --> 19:35.708
I will follow wherever these oars

248
19:35.791 --> 19:38.250
may carry our love.

249
20:35.416 --> 20:37.125
My bracelet.

250
20:37.208 --> 20:40.041
My bracelet, Rus.

251
20:40.666 --> 20:42.958
My bracelet…

252
21:06.333 --> 21:08.625
Don't.

253
21:09.333 --> 21:11.583
Don't take it, Rus.

254
21:42.875 --> 21:43.916
Mandau.

255
21:44.875 --> 21:47.333
Honey! Thief!

256
21:47.416 --> 21:48.916
There's been a thief!

257
21:49.000 --> 21:50.625
Thief! My bracelet!

258
21:50.708 --> 21:52.458
My bracelet!

259
21:53.708 --> 21:55.708
Hey!

260
22:05.250 --> 22:07.958
It'll be a disaster if the mandau is unsheathed.

261
22:09.416 --> 22:13.166
I need that mandau to catch the kuyang.

262
22:33.125 --> 22:34.500
Damn it, it's broken!

263
23:57.458 --> 24:00.083
Help!

264
24:20.250 --> 24:22.291
Help!

265
24:48.625 --> 24:49.500
Help!

266
24:54.666 --> 24:56.208
Help!

267
25:24.083 --> 25:30.208
Newlyweds of Banjarmasin…

268
25:39.250 --> 25:41.000
What's this for, ma'am?

269
25:42.166 --> 25:46.166
- This is an ancestral tradition. - Okay.

270
25:46.250 --> 25:49.250
- It's so that our event runs smoothly. - Right.

271
25:49.333 --> 25:50.416
Okay.

272
25:50.500 --> 25:52.166
Filled with happiness

273
25:52.250 --> 25:59.250
In this extraordinary wedding…

274
25:59.875 --> 26:02.833
- Is this all the food, Chief? - It seems so.

275
26:02.916 --> 26:06.250
The tent looks luxurious, but the food looks so cheap.

276
26:07.250 --> 26:09.875
The tent was a donation from Rusmiati's mother-in-law.

277
26:09.958 --> 26:13.625
No wonder. Utuh Ampong couldn't have afforded this.

278
26:13.708 --> 26:15.250
Goodness.

279
26:23.958 --> 26:26.541
The groom is here.

280
26:29.291 --> 26:30.958
The groom is so handsome!

281
26:38.125 --> 26:41.875
Allah, send blessings upon Prophet Muhammad.

282
26:41.958 --> 26:44.291
- Send blessings upon him. - Send blessings upon him.

283
28:23.250 --> 28:26.250
I knew it. Someone must have sent a curse.

284
28:26.958 --> 28:29.750
Maybe there are people who don't agree to this marriage.

285
28:29.833 --> 28:33.375
It could be because their fortunes aren't a match.

286
28:33.458 --> 28:36.333
It looks like their marriage will have a lot of problems.

287
28:36.416 --> 28:37.625
What a disaster.

288
28:41.625 --> 28:43.000
ONE YEAR LATER

289
28:43.083 --> 28:45.916
Rus!

290
28:53.250 --> 28:54.208
Oh, no.

291
28:54.875 --> 28:55.916
It's dead.

292
29:25.083 --> 29:27.750
Hang it while it's hot outside. It'll dry quickly.

293
29:33.666 --> 29:34.583
Rus?

294
29:34.666 --> 29:36.625
- Yes, Mom? - What's this?

295
29:37.166 --> 29:39.583
Do I have to keep reminding you to drink the herbal medicine?

296
29:39.666 --> 29:41.708
Sorry, Mom. I forgot.

297
29:42.708 --> 29:44.125
I'm going out.

298
29:44.208 --> 29:47.791
Don't forget to go to the shop and bring food for Badri.

299
29:47.875 --> 29:49.958
Don't let him eat out.

300
29:50.833 --> 29:53.000
Yes, Mom. I'll go to the shop this afternoon.

301
29:56.541 --> 29:58.916
And wash the dirty dishes.

302
30:21.041 --> 30:24.750
TUGU DODOL

303
30:30.625 --> 30:33.000
NIENA GOLD SHOP

304
30:36.458 --> 30:39.666
- Where's Badri? - He's at the workshop with a guest.

305
30:39.750 --> 30:41.000
Who?

306
30:41.083 --> 30:43.625
How have you been? I hope you're well.

307
30:43.708 --> 30:45.041
Yes, I'm doing well.

308
30:45.875 --> 30:47.958
What about your mom?

309
30:48.041 --> 30:50.166
- She's doing well. - Peace be upon you.

310
30:50.250 --> 30:52.375
- Peace be upon you too. - Peace be upon you too.

311
30:52.458 --> 30:54.041
There she is.

312
30:54.125 --> 30:55.125
Come in, honey.

313
30:55.208 --> 30:56.291
NIENA GOLD SHOP WORKSHOP

314
30:56.375 --> 30:57.708
This is Fauziah.

315
30:57.791 --> 31:01.833
She's related to my grandmother in Banjarmasin.

316
31:01.916 --> 31:05.833
Coincidentally, she's also my junior at ULM.

317
31:05.916 --> 31:08.541
We finally meet, Rusmiati.

318
31:10.541 --> 31:11.875
I'm Fauziah.

319
31:12.916 --> 31:15.875
You didn't come to our wedding, did you?

320
31:15.958 --> 31:19.083
No, she didn't. She moved to Java then. Where was it again?

321
31:20.083 --> 31:22.333
- Surabaya. - Yeah, Surabaya.

322
31:22.416 --> 31:24.708
It's been almost a year since she came back.

323
31:24.791 --> 31:27.250
Why did you move to Java? To a private university too.

324
31:27.875 --> 31:31.833
Because you left me to get married, so I decided to leave.

325
31:35.041 --> 31:36.041
I'm joking.

326
31:36.916 --> 31:38.000
I was just kidding.

327
31:38.083 --> 31:40.458
She really likes to joke around.

328
31:41.250 --> 31:45.333
Fauziah's family happens to run the same business as ours.

329
31:45.958 --> 31:47.666
Their gold shops are everywhere.

330
31:48.666 --> 31:51.208
Okay then, you two carry on.

331
31:51.291 --> 31:52.833
Is that for me?

332
31:53.375 --> 31:54.666
Haven't you eaten?

333
31:56.125 --> 31:57.833
Not yet. Bring it here.

334
31:58.416 --> 32:00.625
We were just having a snack.

335
32:05.791 --> 32:07.250
Let's eat together.

336
32:07.333 --> 32:10.291
Rusmiati's cooking is really delicious, you know.

337
32:11.208 --> 32:13.750
Did you really make them all?

338
32:16.791 --> 32:18.833
Badri is very lucky

339
32:18.916 --> 32:21.000
to have a wife who's good at cooking.

340
32:22.500 --> 32:23.958
Get us some plates, honey.

341
32:57.458 --> 33:00.083
Hey, Mom!

342
33:00.166 --> 33:01.916
Why are you splashing the house at night?

343
33:02.000 --> 33:04.916
This is what the psychic advised for the protection of our family.

344
33:05.000 --> 33:08.750
Why would you believe that? It's a sin.

345
33:09.416 --> 33:11.750
This is blessed water!

346
33:11.833 --> 33:13.625
We have to give it a try.

347
33:13.708 --> 33:17.708
I've always felt restless about something since you got married.

348
33:17.791 --> 33:20.708
It's been a year, Mom. Why can't you accept Irus?

349
33:20.791 --> 33:22.208
I have accepted her.

350
33:22.291 --> 33:24.500
But before you have a child,

351
33:24.583 --> 33:25.750
I will remain restless.

352
33:25.833 --> 33:30.000
Your fortune will change once you have children.

353
33:30.083 --> 33:32.791
Advise Rusmiati to drink her herbal medicine regularly.

354
34:07.208 --> 34:08.083
Badri.

355
34:08.666 --> 34:09.583
Yes, honey?

356
34:12.416 --> 34:14.041
If I may be honest,

357
34:15.166 --> 34:17.833
I can't face your mom anymore.

358
34:20.875 --> 34:22.458
Honey, please forgive her.

359
34:23.916 --> 34:26.666
I have to drink the herbal medicine every morning

360
34:26.750 --> 34:28.791
and follow all of your mom's wishes.

361
34:34.125 --> 34:35.583
Please be patient, okay?

362
34:36.916 --> 34:39.833
We'll leave soon.

363
34:42.500 --> 34:44.875
But until when?

364
34:44.958 --> 34:47.708
We can stay at my house in Nagara.

365
34:49.208 --> 34:51.250
But I made a promise to my mom.

366
34:51.875 --> 34:56.208
I promised her that we'd stay here until we had kids.

367
34:56.291 --> 34:58.666
- What if I can't bear children? - Hush!

368
34:58.750 --> 35:00.666
Don't say that.

369
35:01.250 --> 35:04.375
We must keep trying and praying to Allah

370
35:05.041 --> 35:07.625
while waiting for the right time to talk to my mom.

371
35:07.708 --> 35:11.541
Or at least until I can prove that we can be independent.

372
35:11.625 --> 35:14.583
My patience has its limits, you know.

373
35:15.583 --> 35:16.750
By the way.

374
35:17.583 --> 35:21.000
Ziah's dad invited us to start a business together.

375
35:21.083 --> 35:23.000
He wants to open his gold shop

376
35:23.083 --> 35:26.208
in several cities in South Kalimantan, including here.

377
35:26.291 --> 35:28.375
If this happens

378
35:28.458 --> 35:30.458
and it works out, we can save.

379
35:30.541 --> 35:32.833
We can buy our own house and move.

380
35:32.916 --> 35:34.041
That's my plan.

381
35:34.916 --> 35:36.583
You call her Ziah now?

382
35:37.333 --> 35:38.708
Why are we talking about Ziah?

383
35:41.125 --> 35:43.458
Honey, are you jealous?

384
35:45.791 --> 35:47.083
Why would I be?

385
35:47.166 --> 35:49.416
Look at you. You're jealous.

386
35:49.500 --> 35:52.166
Your face says you're jealous. Admit it.

387
35:55.000 --> 35:56.791
I am, a little.

388
35:56.875 --> 35:59.875
Because Fauziah is beautiful.

389
36:04.250 --> 36:06.166
You're much more beautiful, honey.

390
36:09.000 --> 36:10.791
Nonsense.

391
36:10.875 --> 36:13.125
You'd better be careful.

392
36:13.208 --> 36:16.416
Remember the goal of this collaboration.

393
36:17.250 --> 36:19.291
Yes, I promise.

394
36:19.375 --> 36:21.000
I won't mess up.

395
36:22.791 --> 36:25.208
We'll be able to move out of this house soon.

396
36:27.125 --> 36:28.000
Honey.

397
36:29.875 --> 36:32.083
How about we make a baby tonight?

398
36:33.708 --> 36:35.708
You're so naughty.

399
36:47.583 --> 36:50.833
You must drink herbal medicine regularly

400
36:51.958 --> 36:55.250
to restore your womb.

401
36:58.041 --> 36:59.833
In my family,

402
37:00.833 --> 37:03.833
there is no woman

403
37:04.583 --> 37:06.041
who is barren.

404
37:18.583 --> 37:20.833
If there are still wrinkles,

405
37:20.916 --> 37:23.000
that means you didn't iron it properly.

406
37:30.083 --> 37:32.625
Keep slamming the door!

407
37:32.708 --> 37:35.125
Do it harder if you can.

408
37:35.750 --> 37:37.958
Let the hinges break.

409
37:38.750 --> 37:42.583
You should listen to your elders.

410
37:42.666 --> 37:47.083
Don't just pretend that you understand.

411
38:01.458 --> 38:02.500
Honey?

412
38:06.125 --> 38:09.166
Is Irus good at complaining now?

413
38:09.250 --> 38:12.500
Mom, that's enough. Have pity on Irus.

414
38:12.583 --> 38:14.666
Your wife brings bad luck.

415
38:14.750 --> 38:17.000
Your dad said that our shop is getting quieter.

416
38:17.083 --> 38:19.541
That's because you didn't believe in the prediction.

417
38:19.625 --> 38:23.416
Mom, stop it. The neighbors will hear.

418
38:23.500 --> 38:25.458
Irus wants to go back to Nagara.

419
38:25.541 --> 38:27.000
Good.

420
38:27.083 --> 38:29.708
Good!

421
38:29.791 --> 38:30.958
She's talking back now.

422
38:31.041 --> 38:34.541
If she wants to go, then go. But she'd better not dare come back.

423
38:34.625 --> 38:36.000
Ever.

424
38:44.041 --> 38:45.125
Honey?

425
38:49.208 --> 38:50.750
Honey, it's me.

426
38:50.833 --> 38:52.916
IMAS: COME VISIT ME WHEN YOU HAVE THE TIME.

427
38:53.000 --> 38:55.666
YOU CAN ALWAYS TALK TO ME. MAY YOU ALWAYS BE HAPPY THERE.

428
38:55.750 --> 38:57.333
Honey.

429
38:58.208 --> 38:59.750
It's me, honey.

430
39:10.458 --> 39:11.666
Honey?

431
39:15.083 --> 39:17.333
Honey, please don't do this.

432
39:17.416 --> 39:19.583
Please, honey.

433
39:21.458 --> 39:23.125
Honey, please be patient.

434
39:23.791 --> 39:26.333
No. I'm done being patient.

435
39:28.625 --> 39:32.291
My patience has run out.

436
39:32.375 --> 39:34.250
Please wait for the right time.

437
39:34.833 --> 39:38.541
It's not that I don't want to take you to Nagara, but please wait.

438
39:40.125 --> 39:43.458
Badri, I'm only staying here because of you.

439
39:43.541 --> 39:47.083
But I'll lose my mind facing your mom eventually.

440
39:47.791 --> 39:49.416
Honey…

441
39:53.291 --> 39:56.958
Tomorrow, my dad and I are going to Banjarmasin.

442
39:57.625 --> 40:01.083
We plan to bring forward our cooperation with Haji Jarni.

443
40:01.750 --> 40:05.458
After I return from Banjarmasin, I'll take you to Nagara, okay?

444
40:07.416 --> 40:09.208
Honey, I promise.

445
40:09.291 --> 40:11.791
I'm okay with us living in Nagara.

446
40:11.875 --> 40:15.083
I’ll just commute to the shop for work.

447
40:17.333 --> 40:20.458
But wait for me to come back from Banjarmasin, okay?

448
40:21.250 --> 40:23.125
Please, honey.

449
40:24.916 --> 40:26.416
You'll wait, right?

450
40:33.750 --> 40:34.791
Honey?

451
40:35.375 --> 40:37.333
Honey, is there another thief?

452
40:37.416 --> 40:38.375
Honey?

453
40:42.041 --> 40:43.000
Honey!

454
40:55.750 --> 40:57.791
What was that, honey?

455
40:59.875 --> 41:03.291
I found this next to my baby.

456
41:14.125 --> 41:15.541
Whose hair is that?

457
41:29.000 --> 41:30.583
I got you!

458
41:30.666 --> 41:31.791
Got what?

459
41:31.875 --> 41:33.791
The mandau

460
41:33.875 --> 41:37.208
can tell where the kuyang is.

461
42:57.666 --> 43:01.000
I will throw you out, away from the village.

462
43:01.083 --> 43:03.000
Don't bother the residents anymore.

463
43:03.083 --> 43:04.791
If you come back,

464
43:05.375 --> 43:06.833
this mandau

465
43:07.500 --> 43:11.208
will find you and chase you mercilessly.

466
43:18.416 --> 43:21.083
Dad, we're all set.

467
43:23.958 --> 43:26.708
Dad? Why aren't you ready yet?

468
43:27.250 --> 43:29.833
I've had a fever since dawn.

469
43:29.916 --> 43:33.583
It seems like I can't go to Banjarmasin.

470
43:36.333 --> 43:37.875
And diarrhea too.

471
43:37.958 --> 43:39.333
Yes, a stomachache.

472
43:40.000 --> 43:43.083
But we promised Haji Jarni.

473
43:43.166 --> 43:44.625
Should we cancel the meeting?

474
43:44.708 --> 43:46.666
You should go.

475
43:47.416 --> 43:49.625
I'll contact Haji Jarni later.

476
43:49.708 --> 43:51.958
This is very important to our business,

477
43:52.041 --> 43:54.041
so you should still go.

478
43:56.708 --> 43:57.625
Okay then.

479
43:58.250 --> 43:59.791
Dad, Mom.

480
44:00.541 --> 44:01.791
I'm leaving.

481
44:01.875 --> 44:03.708
- Peace be upon you. - Peace be upon you too.

482
44:03.791 --> 44:05.833
Send my regards to Fauziah.

483
44:06.458 --> 44:09.166
Tell her to come here if she has the time.

484
44:10.125 --> 44:11.791
Yes, Mom. Peace be upon you.

485
44:11.875 --> 44:13.166
Peace be upon you too.

486
44:13.250 --> 44:15.041
- See you. - Be careful on the road.

487
44:15.125 --> 44:16.083
I will.

488
44:28.291 --> 44:29.291
Rus.

489
44:29.916 --> 44:32.125
There's something we want to talk about.

490
44:32.708 --> 44:34.500
This year,

491
44:34.583 --> 44:37.458
sales at our gold shop have decreased significantly.

492
44:38.000 --> 44:39.500
Every month,

493
44:39.583 --> 44:42.208
we're operating at a loss.

494
44:42.291 --> 44:44.041
Believe it or not,

495
44:44.125 --> 44:47.125
our business has been declining since Badri got married.

496
44:49.250 --> 44:50.208
Rus.

497
44:51.333 --> 44:55.041
Do you remember the prediction I told you about?

498
44:55.791 --> 44:57.541
Maybe this is the reason.

499
44:58.708 --> 45:00.333
Mom, Dad.

500
45:00.416 --> 45:02.750
Shouldn't we wait for Badri?

501
45:02.833 --> 45:04.500
It makes no difference.

502
45:04.583 --> 45:07.166
The important thing is that Irus knows first.

503
45:07.250 --> 45:10.875
It's not that I don't accept you as my daughter-in-law.

504
45:10.958 --> 45:13.500
I'm always making you those herbal drinks, aren't I?

505
45:14.666 --> 45:17.833
It's so you can have children soon.

506
45:17.916 --> 45:20.041
Because that's the only way

507
45:20.125 --> 45:22.916
to get rid of the bad luck.

508
45:23.000 --> 45:25.083
Waiting for you to have a child

509
45:25.166 --> 45:27.333
may be difficult for now, Rus.

510
45:27.416 --> 45:32.000
That's why we have a plan for you and Badri.

511
45:32.958 --> 45:34.833
- A plan? - Yes.

512
45:34.916 --> 45:36.625
The only way

513
45:37.666 --> 45:39.666
is for Badri to marry another wife.

514
45:40.875 --> 45:42.250
Marry who?

515
45:42.333 --> 45:45.333
Fauziah, Haji Jarni's daughter.

516
46:02.375 --> 46:07.333
IRUS, INCOMING CALL

517
46:12.750 --> 46:14.750
IRUS, INCOMING CALL

518
46:20.083 --> 46:22.791
IRUS, INCOMING CALL

519
46:31.791 --> 46:32.833
Hello, Rus?

520
46:33.458 --> 46:34.833
Who's this?

521
46:35.500 --> 46:36.791
Where's Badri?

522
46:36.875 --> 46:38.958
This is Fauziah.

523
46:40.750 --> 46:42.500
Badri is in the bathroom.

524
46:42.583 --> 46:44.750
Do you want to leave a message?

525
47:02.250 --> 47:03.375
Thank you.

526
48:01.333 --> 48:03.375
Our patience has run out.

527
48:04.416 --> 48:06.958
I give Irus herbal medicine every day

528
48:07.875 --> 48:11.500
so she can have children soon.

529
48:12.166 --> 48:14.541
Please be patient, Hajjah Saidah.

530
48:14.625 --> 48:19.083
Maybe Rusmiati isn't ready to be blessed with a child by God yet.

531
48:19.166 --> 48:22.375
This is the best plan for Irus.

532
48:23.000 --> 48:26.208
Badri marrying another wife is not a bad thing.

533
48:27.541 --> 48:31.250
Irus will remain the first wife.

534
48:31.333 --> 48:33.375
She'll still have the same rights.

535
48:35.250 --> 48:38.125
Okay, I'll talk to Irus about it later.

536
49:09.416 --> 49:13.500
Mom, I can't take it anymore!

537
49:15.125 --> 49:18.250
Please help me, Mom.

538
49:19.458 --> 49:24.333
Take me with you.

539
49:25.375 --> 49:29.125
I'm ready to die, Mom.

540
49:33.500 --> 49:35.625
My dad absolutely loves you.

541
49:37.791 --> 49:41.333
Maybe because I'm his only daughter,

542
49:42.000 --> 49:44.500
so he already sees you as his own son.

543
49:46.291 --> 49:49.916
That's why he wants to work with you.

544
49:50.958 --> 49:53.291
But you always refused.

545
49:55.833 --> 49:58.125
Well, I was still in college back then.

546
49:58.750 --> 50:02.375
I didn't dare to work with him. His business was already so big.

547
50:04.458 --> 50:06.333
That's my point.

548
50:07.666 --> 50:10.583
I can't run my dad's business.

549
50:14.458 --> 50:17.166
I couldn't be happier

550
50:17.250 --> 50:19.791
because you agreed to the partnership.

551
50:21.875 --> 50:23.125
I'm certain

552
50:23.208 --> 50:26.291
that this business will succeed even more with you leading it.

553
50:30.000 --> 50:31.500
Do you know why…

554
50:35.291 --> 50:37.708
I decided to move to Java

555
50:37.791 --> 50:39.750
to continue my studies?

556
50:42.375 --> 50:43.416
Why?

557
50:47.250 --> 50:48.166
Because…

558
50:52.166 --> 50:54.500
you told me that you were getting married

559
50:56.208 --> 50:57.583
out of nowhere.

560
51:08.041 --> 51:10.708
I'm so stupid.

561
51:14.458 --> 51:18.583
I know you're already married.

562
51:25.833 --> 51:28.041
But I still can't bear to lose you.

563
51:34.250 --> 51:35.666
That's why

564
51:38.166 --> 51:39.291
I agreed

565
51:40.500 --> 51:44.333
when your mom asked me to be your second wife.

566
51:49.416 --> 51:51.250
I'm willing, Badri.

567
53:52.750 --> 53:54.041
Irus.

568
53:54.958 --> 53:57.333
- Come back, Irus. - Help!

569
53:57.958 --> 53:58.958
Help!

570
54:13.541 --> 54:15.583
It's been a while since we've been here.

571
54:16.416 --> 54:19.375
Yes, I haven't been in Siring for more than two years.

572
54:19.458 --> 54:22.291
- Well… - But not much has changed, huh?

573
54:23.791 --> 54:25.708
- Something's changed, though. - Meatballs.

574
54:25.791 --> 54:26.916
What?

575
54:28.500 --> 54:30.541
You're no longer single.

576
54:32.833 --> 54:34.208
Let's have a snack.

577
54:35.875 --> 54:37.333
We'd like some, please.

578
54:37.416 --> 54:38.458
Help yourself.

579
54:38.541 --> 54:41.083
Let me do it.

580
54:42.625 --> 54:43.875
Open your mouth.

581
54:45.875 --> 54:48.375
Come on. Open your mouth.

582
54:48.458 --> 54:49.708
She's about to feed you.

583
54:54.166 --> 54:55.583
Good, isn't it?

584
54:55.666 --> 54:58.041
- It's delicious. - Of course it is.

585
54:58.125 --> 54:59.291
It's because she's gorgeous.

586
54:59.375 --> 55:01.875
I'd love some too, you know.

587
55:01.958 --> 55:03.375
I'll even eat a stone.

588
55:04.208 --> 55:06.166
Here's a stone. Want some?

589
55:06.250 --> 55:09.208
Oh, darling. This…

590
55:18.666 --> 55:19.833
Peace be upon you.

591
55:27.083 --> 55:28.500
Peace be upon you.

592
57:22.000 --> 57:23.375
Who are you?

593
57:51.166 --> 57:54.083
If you don't want your body to rot,

594
57:55.416 --> 57:57.833
listen to my request.

595
58:13.375 --> 58:17.791
IF YOU WANT TO LEARN QUICKLY, STUDY WHILE LOOKING AT DAD'S PHOTO

596
59:22.333 --> 59:23.833
Whatever.

597
59:23.916 --> 59:26.041
- Who is that? - I don't know.

598
59:26.875 --> 59:28.250
Oh, it's Badri.

599
59:28.333 --> 59:30.500
I thought you were a scavenger.

600
59:31.250 --> 59:33.791
- A scavenger? - Yes, Chief, it's me.

601
59:33.875 --> 59:36.166
I'm staying at Irus's house.

602
59:36.250 --> 59:38.791
Oh, good. Don't leave the house for too long.

603
59:38.875 --> 59:40.208
Yeah.

604
59:40.291 --> 59:43.791
Have you heard? Last night, someone was attacked by a kuyang.

605
59:43.875 --> 59:45.750
- What? Kuyang? - Yes.

606
59:45.833 --> 59:48.125
Be careful, especially Rus.

607
59:48.208 --> 59:50.750
But you don't need to worry since you don't have children

608
59:50.833 --> 59:52.250
and Rusmiati isn't pregnant.

609
59:52.333 --> 59:53.916
She isn't pregnant, is she?

610
59:54.625 --> 59:55.625
Not yet, Chief.

611
59:55.708 --> 59:57.708
- There's no need to worry then. - Yes.

612
59:57.791 --> 01:00:01.666
Okay, we're going around the village. We're patrolling at night again.

613
01:00:01.750 --> 01:00:03.125
- Right. - Excuse us.

614
01:00:03.208 --> 01:00:04.958
- Yes. - Come on.

615
01:00:05.875 --> 01:00:07.250
See you.

616
01:00:09.083 --> 01:00:12.208
Chief, do you know why Rusmiati moved here?

617
01:00:12.291 --> 01:00:14.000
Because she can't bear children.

618
01:00:14.083 --> 01:00:17.250
That mouth of yours. Stop gossiping.

619
01:00:17.333 --> 01:00:20.125
If you gossip too much, your teeth will grow longer.

620
01:00:20.208 --> 01:00:21.625
Let's continue the patrol.

621
01:00:22.291 --> 01:00:26.333
If you want to gossip, do it with me. I need some hot news.

622
01:00:40.125 --> 01:00:41.291
Rus?

623
01:00:48.875 --> 01:00:51.958
We were apart for two nights.

624
01:00:52.791 --> 01:00:55.291
I missed you so much.

625
01:00:59.666 --> 01:01:01.125
Do you?

626
01:01:01.875 --> 01:01:04.666
You didn't leave just for business, did you?

627
01:01:05.291 --> 01:01:07.166
You had someone accompany you.

628
01:01:08.000 --> 01:01:09.666
I don't matter.

629
01:01:10.666 --> 01:01:11.875
Honey.

630
01:01:12.583 --> 01:01:16.166
My sister told me about that family talk.

631
01:01:18.000 --> 01:01:22.125
It was rude of them to have that talk without me there.

632
01:01:29.916 --> 01:01:32.166
What if your parents force you?

633
01:01:34.250 --> 01:01:35.791
Come on, honey.

634
01:01:38.708 --> 01:01:40.916
You're more than enough for me.

635
01:01:42.000 --> 01:01:43.625
Trust me.

636
01:01:46.125 --> 01:01:48.541
You spent a lot of time alone with her, didn't you?

637
01:01:49.166 --> 01:01:50.500
What did she say?

638
01:01:51.375 --> 01:01:54.166
Honey, don't overthink it.

639
01:01:54.250 --> 01:01:55.875
Don't start imagining things.

640
01:01:59.208 --> 01:02:01.666
Let me make up for all the time apart.

641
01:02:09.416 --> 01:02:11.375
You look so beautiful tonight.

642
01:02:27.000 --> 01:02:28.541
Is that a new necklace?

643
01:02:29.208 --> 01:02:30.666
I've never seen it before.

644
01:02:32.916 --> 01:02:35.416
My brother-in-law gave me the necklace.

645
01:02:36.041 --> 01:02:38.208
It makes me itch,

646
01:02:38.833 --> 01:02:41.250
so I wrapped it in cloth.

647
01:02:41.958 --> 01:02:43.375
Why?

648
01:02:43.458 --> 01:02:45.208
Nothing.

649
01:02:45.291 --> 01:02:46.708
It looks good.

650
01:03:17.250 --> 01:03:19.083
You're still young.

651
01:03:20.416 --> 01:03:23.708
I don't recommend it because it's highly risky.

652
01:03:34.375 --> 01:03:36.250
Once you're caught,

653
01:03:37.791 --> 01:03:39.916
it's over.

654
01:03:42.458 --> 01:03:46.250
You won't get any benefit from this practice.

655
01:03:49.500 --> 01:03:52.041
Because to survive,

656
01:03:52.791 --> 01:03:55.708
you have to replace human blood with livestock blood.

657
01:04:01.416 --> 01:04:06.333
Be grateful if you meet someone like your brother-in-law.

658
01:04:09.875 --> 01:04:11.458
He knows very well

659
01:04:13.666 --> 01:04:15.625
that this practice does not kill.

660
01:04:24.666 --> 01:04:26.916
But the villagers don't.

661
01:04:30.625 --> 01:04:32.625
They will be very cruel.

662
01:04:54.583 --> 01:04:57.708
This power can only be transferred

663
01:04:58.333 --> 01:05:01.083
to someone who wants it.

664
01:05:03.166 --> 01:05:05.041
I'm lucky

665
01:05:05.125 --> 01:05:06.958
that you came.

666
01:05:08.583 --> 01:05:12.375
After this, I can live normally and return to society,

667
01:05:12.458 --> 01:05:14.583
even if I have to move to another village.

668
01:05:30.750 --> 01:05:33.541
Before I apply this kuyang oil,

669
01:05:35.750 --> 01:05:38.958
I'll give you time to think again.

670
01:05:43.083 --> 01:05:46.208
I am willing to accept the power of kuyang

671
01:05:46.291 --> 01:05:48.458
and all its risks.

672
01:06:43.875 --> 01:06:45.208
Rus.

673
01:06:59.083 --> 01:07:01.541
You look so beautiful, honey.

674
01:07:02.500 --> 01:07:04.500
I love you more and more.

675
01:07:06.541 --> 01:07:11.250
By the way, the chief is holding a gathering tonight.

676
01:07:11.333 --> 01:07:13.875
He invited us. Let's go, okay?

677
01:07:32.875 --> 01:07:37.041
Wow, Irus. You look beautiful.

678
01:07:37.125 --> 01:07:39.333
You just look different. Am I right?

679
01:07:39.416 --> 01:07:43.541
Yes, even more beautiful than usual.

680
01:07:43.625 --> 01:07:45.625
Just a minute, Rus.

681
01:07:45.708 --> 01:07:48.416
I have to help the other ladies.

682
01:07:55.416 --> 01:07:56.958
Rusmiati, just sit here.

683
01:07:57.041 --> 01:07:59.166
The others are already helping.

684
01:08:21.875 --> 01:08:23.291
Oh, dear.

685
01:08:23.375 --> 01:08:26.583
Come here. Don't cry.

686
01:08:26.666 --> 01:08:28.000
It's okay.

687
01:08:28.083 --> 01:08:31.958
Peace and blessings

688
01:08:32.041 --> 01:08:35.958
be upon him.

689
01:08:36.041 --> 01:08:40.083
May Allah bless Muhammad.

690
01:08:40.166 --> 01:08:44.333
O Lord, send prayers and peace.

691
01:08:44.416 --> 01:08:50.666
O Prophet, peace be upon you.

692
01:08:50.750 --> 01:08:57.250
O Messenger, peace be upon you.

693
01:08:57.333 --> 01:09:03.708
O Beloved, peace be upon you.

694
01:09:03.791 --> 01:09:10.500
May Allah's blessings be upon you.

695
01:09:10.583 --> 01:09:16.541
O Allah, send prayers, peace, and blessings upon him and his family.

696
01:09:17.916 --> 01:09:20.416
In the name of Allah, the Most Gracious, the Most Merciful.

697
01:09:20.500 --> 01:09:25.250
I name this child Johansyah, son of Jumberan.

698
01:09:25.333 --> 01:09:30.000
- May Allah bless you. Al-Fatihah. - Amen.

699
01:09:30.083 --> 01:09:31.833
In the name of Allah, the Most Gracious, the Most Merciful.

700
01:09:31.916 --> 01:09:33.666
All praise is due to Allah, Lord of all worlds.

701
01:09:33.750 --> 01:09:35.833
O Allah, send prayers and peace upon Prophet Muhammad,

702
01:09:35.916 --> 01:09:37.833
and his family, and all his companions.

703
01:09:37.916 --> 01:09:38.833
Amen.

704
01:09:38.916 --> 01:09:44.708
May Johansyah grow up to be a devoted and respectful son to his parents.

705
01:09:54.625 --> 01:09:56.958
Where's the bathroom?

706
01:09:57.041 --> 01:09:58.875
It's inside.

707
01:10:11.583 --> 01:10:12.583
Rus?

708
01:10:15.500 --> 01:10:16.666
Hey, Rus?

709
01:10:17.583 --> 01:10:19.083
What's wrong, Rus?

710
01:10:19.833 --> 01:10:21.958
May I take my leave?

711
01:10:23.791 --> 01:10:25.583
I feel sick.

712
01:10:26.916 --> 01:10:28.416
Yes, that's okay.

713
01:10:28.500 --> 01:10:30.416
The event is almost over.

714
01:10:30.500 --> 01:10:32.166
Go get some rest.

715
01:10:34.958 --> 01:10:37.208
Well, ladies and gentlemen.

716
01:10:37.833 --> 01:10:41.958
Prophet Muhammad mentioned in his hadith

717
01:10:42.041 --> 01:10:46.750
that we have obligations as parents to our children.

718
01:10:46.833 --> 01:10:50.208
"Haqqul waladi ala walidihi."

719
01:10:50.291 --> 01:10:53.041
That means a child's rights over their parents,

720
01:10:53.125 --> 01:10:57.125
or rather, a parent's duties to their child.

721
01:10:57.208 --> 01:11:00.875
First, give the child a good name…

722
01:11:00.958 --> 01:11:03.333
- Where are you going? - I need to pee, ma'am.

723
01:11:03.416 --> 01:11:05.291
Go then.

724
01:11:05.375 --> 01:11:11.875
We have witnessed the chief giving the best name to his son.

725
01:11:11.958 --> 01:11:16.083
A child's name shouldn't be chosen lightly.

726
01:12:04.541 --> 01:12:06.208
Oh, God!

727
01:12:06.958 --> 01:12:08.583
Kuyang!

728
01:12:08.666 --> 01:12:11.083
Kuyang!

729
01:12:11.166 --> 01:12:13.833
Kuyang!

730
01:12:15.041 --> 01:12:19.958
Hurry!

731
01:12:21.458 --> 01:12:22.833
Honey.

732
01:12:22.916 --> 01:12:25.958
Something bad happened when you left.

733
01:12:26.041 --> 01:12:27.375
There was a ku…

734
01:13:06.500 --> 01:13:08.458
- Here. - That's enough.

735
01:13:08.541 --> 01:13:10.375
It's okay, Rus.

736
01:13:10.458 --> 01:13:12.416
Take one more.

737
01:13:12.500 --> 01:13:14.541
You can pay me fifty thousand.

738
01:13:14.625 --> 01:13:15.500
All right then.

739
01:13:27.291 --> 01:13:30.916
- I'll take them. - Okay. Deal.

740
01:13:33.625 --> 01:13:36.833
Honey. If you're still sick, there's no need to cook.

741
01:13:37.625 --> 01:13:39.541
Let's just buy lunch.

742
01:13:39.625 --> 01:13:41.166
I'm already feeling better.

743
01:13:41.250 --> 01:13:44.333
I want to cook your favorite dish, grilled snakehead fish.

744
01:13:44.416 --> 01:13:45.750
Thank goodness.

745
01:13:45.833 --> 01:13:48.541
The patrols are being conducted again because of the kuyang sighting.

746
01:13:48.625 --> 01:13:52.416
I want to join, but I come home late.

747
01:13:52.500 --> 01:13:54.708
Don't worry about it.

748
01:13:59.791 --> 01:14:01.875
That's it!

749
01:14:02.708 --> 01:14:04.708
Keep going.

750
01:14:06.541 --> 01:14:09.791
Yes, just like that.

751
01:14:09.875 --> 01:14:10.958
A little bit more.

752
01:14:15.416 --> 01:14:18.708
Utuh Ampong hasn't returned from Samarinda yet.

753
01:14:19.375 --> 01:14:21.958
That means we all have to be more careful.

754
01:14:22.916 --> 01:14:25.625
Especially your wife, Rustam. She's about to give birth.

755
01:14:25.708 --> 01:14:29.708
They said that the kuyang has been caught by Utuh Ampong?

756
01:14:29.791 --> 01:14:32.625
Yes, she was caught and exiled to a village downstream.

757
01:14:33.291 --> 01:14:35.041
But the thing is,

758
01:14:35.125 --> 01:14:38.166
what if someone else is practicing kuyang?

759
01:14:38.250 --> 01:14:41.958
I heard that this kuyang is different from the one before.

760
01:14:42.041 --> 01:14:43.666
It looks younger.

761
01:14:54.666 --> 01:14:55.916
Push. Yes, harder!

762
01:14:57.458 --> 01:14:59.166
- You can do it. Harder! - Push!

763
01:14:59.250 --> 01:15:00.500
You can do this.

764
01:15:02.250 --> 01:15:03.750
Push!

765
01:15:07.416 --> 01:15:09.541
Praise be to God, Rustam.

766
01:15:09.625 --> 01:15:11.250
Your baby has been born.

767
01:15:11.333 --> 01:15:13.000
We have another villager now.

768
01:15:13.083 --> 01:15:14.458
Praise be to God.

769
01:15:14.541 --> 01:15:17.666
Finally, I have a child who can continue my legacy.

770
01:15:17.750 --> 01:15:20.333
Congratulations, Rustam.

771
01:15:20.416 --> 01:15:22.125
Rustam Junior!

772
01:15:22.208 --> 01:15:25.541
Oh, stop it. Go inside and see your baby.

773
01:15:25.625 --> 01:15:26.958
Okay.

774
01:15:27.750 --> 01:15:29.291
Praise be to God.

775
01:15:29.875 --> 01:15:32.083
Chief, what's "junior"?

776
01:15:32.166 --> 01:15:34.666
You idiot. Don't you know?

777
01:15:34.750 --> 01:15:36.208
"Junior" means child.

778
01:16:25.500 --> 01:16:28.041
Kuyang!

779
01:16:30.916 --> 01:16:34.250
Hey, everyone! Gather around!

780
01:16:34.333 --> 01:16:36.250
There's a kuyang in Rustam's house!

781
01:16:36.333 --> 01:16:38.041
- Gather! - Kuyang!

782
01:16:38.125 --> 01:16:40.041
- There's a kuyang! - Kuyang!

783
01:16:40.125 --> 01:16:42.875
- Kuyang! - Hey, gather around!

784
01:16:42.958 --> 01:16:44.916
There's a kuyang in Rustam's house!

785
01:16:45.000 --> 01:16:47.625
Gather around!

786
01:16:49.833 --> 01:16:50.958
Honey?

787
01:16:52.291 --> 01:16:53.458
Honey.

788
01:16:56.500 --> 01:16:57.750
Honey.

789
01:16:57.833 --> 01:16:59.458
Wake up, honey.

790
01:17:00.666 --> 01:17:01.791
Honey!

791
01:17:01.875 --> 01:17:04.333
Honey, wake up!

792
01:17:04.416 --> 01:17:06.708
Honey!

793
01:17:09.125 --> 01:17:11.458
Let's catch it at its house.

794
01:17:11.541 --> 01:17:13.708
- We have to find it! - Let's find it!

795
01:17:15.041 --> 01:17:18.833
- What's the commotion about, Chief? - There is a kuyang in our village.

796
01:17:18.916 --> 01:17:20.041
Go check your house.

797
01:17:20.125 --> 01:17:22.041
- Check on Rusmiati. - Yes, Chief.

798
01:17:22.125 --> 01:17:24.041
Udin and Ibir, go with Badri.

799
01:17:24.125 --> 01:17:25.791
You guys, check there. The rest, come with me.

800
01:17:25.875 --> 01:17:27.833
- Yes, Chief. - Come on!

801
01:17:29.083 --> 01:17:30.541
Let's go!

802
01:17:30.625 --> 01:17:32.208
Come on.

803
01:17:34.041 --> 01:17:35.250
Honey.

804
01:17:41.833 --> 01:17:43.041
Honey?

805
01:17:46.166 --> 01:17:47.333
Rus?

806
01:17:54.916 --> 01:17:55.916
Rus?

807
01:17:58.583 --> 01:18:00.041
Are you in the kitchen?

808
01:18:09.958 --> 01:18:12.291
- Did you hear something fall? - Yeah, I did.

809
01:18:13.541 --> 01:18:15.333
Din, hold the spear.

810
01:18:21.333 --> 01:18:23.625
Come on, stab it!

811
01:18:29.458 --> 01:18:32.333
It's just a wig. I thought it was a kuyang.

812
01:18:32.416 --> 01:18:35.541
If this really were a kuyang, I'd put it in the freezer.

813
01:18:35.625 --> 01:18:36.916
Why?

814
01:18:37.000 --> 01:18:38.750
It'd become a frozen kuyang!

815
01:18:39.458 --> 01:18:41.750
If I were you, I'd put it in the washing machine.

816
01:18:41.833 --> 01:18:44.458
- Why the washing machine? - To make its head spin around.

817
01:18:44.541 --> 01:18:46.291
It'd have vertigo and wouldn't be able to fly.

818
01:18:48.541 --> 01:18:51.416
Put it in there while the washing machine is still on.

819
01:18:51.500 --> 01:18:53.458
- Look. - Din.

820
01:18:53.541 --> 01:18:55.041
Why is the washing machine working?

821
01:18:55.125 --> 01:18:57.708
It's broken. Where did the electricity come from?

822
01:19:01.375 --> 01:19:03.041
Kuyang!

823
01:20:09.166 --> 01:20:10.875
Rusmiati!

824
01:20:10.958 --> 01:20:12.375
Open up, Rus!

825
01:20:13.208 --> 01:20:14.458
Rusmiati!

826
01:20:16.666 --> 01:20:17.958
Open the door!

827
01:20:18.625 --> 01:20:20.458
I know what you are!

828
01:20:20.541 --> 01:20:22.541
You killed my wife!

829
01:20:25.416 --> 01:20:27.458
Rusmiati!

830
01:20:27.541 --> 01:20:30.125
My wife died because of you!

831
01:20:30.208 --> 01:20:31.875
Come out!

832
01:20:35.125 --> 01:20:36.125
Rustam!

833
01:20:37.125 --> 01:20:39.666
Why are you shouting at Rusmiati's house?

834
01:20:39.750 --> 01:20:42.166
Chief, the kuyang…

835
01:20:42.250 --> 01:20:44.625
Rusmiati is the kuyang!

836
01:20:44.708 --> 01:20:46.250
She's the one who killed my wife!

837
01:20:46.333 --> 01:20:47.958
How do you know she's the kuyang?

838
01:20:51.208 --> 01:20:55.291
I saw a red scar around her neck!

839
01:20:55.375 --> 01:20:56.833
Are you sure, Rustam?

840
01:20:56.916 --> 01:21:00.750
She could have learned it.

841
01:21:02.500 --> 01:21:06.458
That's true. The previous kuyang's house has been empty.

842
01:21:07.625 --> 01:21:09.916
She killed my wife, Chief!

843
01:21:11.583 --> 01:21:14.541
She killed my wife!

844
01:21:28.541 --> 01:21:30.083
Where's Badri?

845
01:21:30.166 --> 01:21:32.416
- Hey, Rustam! - My wife…

846
01:21:32.500 --> 01:21:34.958
- Where's Badri? - Honey…

847
01:21:35.041 --> 01:21:36.666
Let's just check the house.

848
01:21:36.750 --> 01:21:39.166
Look in the room. You check over there.

849
01:23:22.416 --> 01:23:23.291
Stop!

850
01:23:24.708 --> 01:23:27.541
I don't want you to see me like this, Badri.

851
01:23:27.625 --> 01:23:30.333
Honey, why does it have to be like this?

852
01:23:31.083 --> 01:23:34.041
- The incident earlier-- - It wasn't me!

853
01:23:34.750 --> 01:23:37.791
The bleeding happened before I came.

854
01:23:37.875 --> 01:23:40.166
I didn't do anything!

855
01:23:40.250 --> 01:23:42.500
I believe you.

856
01:23:43.416 --> 01:23:46.750
But you didn't have to do all of this.

857
01:23:46.833 --> 01:23:50.541
I did it because of you, Badri.

858
01:23:51.208 --> 01:23:54.041
I was afraid of losing you.

859
01:24:01.541 --> 01:24:03.500
I know this is my fault.

860
01:24:05.208 --> 01:24:07.583
I don't want to lose you either.

861
01:24:09.416 --> 01:24:11.875
And I have no intention

862
01:24:11.958 --> 01:24:14.583
of following my parents' request.

863
01:24:16.500 --> 01:24:18.250
Trust me.

864
01:24:20.958 --> 01:24:22.541
Ziah.

865
01:24:22.625 --> 01:24:25.583
There, there. Don't cry.

866
01:24:26.458 --> 01:24:28.791
I understand how you feel.

867
01:24:32.875 --> 01:24:35.291
But I truly love Rusmiati deeply.

868
01:24:36.750 --> 01:24:39.541
And I can't possibly betray my wedding vows.

869
01:24:40.416 --> 01:24:42.250
But I love you deeply too.

870
01:24:42.333 --> 01:24:44.833
Not everything has to be forced.

871
01:24:45.458 --> 01:24:48.208
If you persist, someone will definitely get hurt.

872
01:24:49.208 --> 01:24:52.750
If I had to choose, I would definitely choose Rusmiati.

873
01:24:52.833 --> 01:24:55.541
Even if that means canceling our business partnership.

874
01:24:57.291 --> 01:24:59.625
And Haji Jarni agreed

875
01:24:59.708 --> 01:25:02.541
to collaborate without any family ties.

876
01:25:03.250 --> 01:25:06.166
Our business will progress further.

877
01:25:07.500 --> 01:25:11.958
We don't need to worry anymore about the prediction.

878
01:25:12.541 --> 01:25:14.875
Badri! Rusmiati!

879
01:25:14.958 --> 01:25:16.416
I know you guys are in there!

880
01:25:17.250 --> 01:25:18.583
Come out!

881
01:25:19.291 --> 01:25:22.500
If you don't come out, we'll pull the house!

882
01:25:22.583 --> 01:25:29.125
- Pull it! - Pull it!

883
01:25:29.208 --> 01:25:33.000
- Pull! - Pull!

884
01:25:51.750 --> 01:25:55.083
Let's just burn it. Burn it!

885
01:26:05.041 --> 01:26:05.875
Burn it!

886
01:26:05.958 --> 01:26:07.833
Pull it!

887
01:26:12.291 --> 01:26:14.125
Die!

888
01:26:17.041 --> 01:26:18.916
A life for a life!

889
01:26:32.166 --> 01:26:35.958
- Burn! - Burn!

890
01:26:36.041 --> 01:26:40.083
- Burn! - Burn!

891
01:26:40.166 --> 01:26:44.083
- Burn! - Burn!

892
01:26:44.166 --> 01:26:49.333
- Burn! - Burn!

893
01:26:49.416 --> 01:26:52.958
- Burn! - Burn!

894
01:27:08.875 --> 01:27:13.708
- Pull! - Pull!

895
01:27:14.291 --> 01:27:15.291
Honey.

896
01:27:16.208 --> 01:27:18.416
I'm taking your body.

897
01:27:18.500 --> 01:27:19.958
Come back.

898
01:27:21.333 --> 01:27:24.833
But what about those people?

899
01:27:24.916 --> 01:27:31.333
- Burn! - Pull!

900
01:27:31.416 --> 01:27:33.458
We're getting out of here, honey.

901
01:27:33.541 --> 01:27:35.375
We'll be together again.

902
01:27:36.750 --> 01:27:37.958
Come back!

903
01:27:58.708 --> 01:28:00.583
Badri, your wound.

904
01:28:00.666 --> 01:28:02.666
I'm okay.

905
01:28:03.541 --> 01:28:05.166
Get in here.

906
01:28:05.250 --> 01:28:07.333
We have to be together.

907
01:28:07.416 --> 01:28:08.958
You must survive.

908
01:28:10.333 --> 01:28:14.000
This jar can't support the weight of two people.

909
01:28:16.458 --> 01:28:18.583
This is my fault, Badri.

910
01:28:18.666 --> 01:28:21.083
It isn't your fault.

911
01:28:21.166 --> 01:28:24.125
I have to face the people.

912
01:28:26.083 --> 01:28:28.708
It was my family who made this happen.

913
01:28:29.833 --> 01:28:31.625
It is my fault too.

914
01:28:32.583 --> 01:28:34.541
So I have to take responsibility.

915
01:28:48.416 --> 01:28:50.583
I love you with all my heart.

916
01:28:56.791 --> 01:28:58.666
Badri!

917
01:29:05.833 --> 01:29:08.000
Badri!

918
01:29:31.750 --> 01:29:34.250
Badri!

919
01:30:51.583 --> 01:30:53.291
Rus!

920
01:30:53.375 --> 01:30:55.666
- Sister. - Rus!

921
01:30:56.666 --> 01:30:58.583
Oh, Rus.

922
01:30:59.708 --> 01:31:00.958
Rus…

923
01:31:03.458 --> 01:31:06.250
Why didn't you tell me

924
01:31:06.333 --> 01:31:07.750
that you were struggling?

925
01:31:13.625 --> 01:31:14.750
Please coordinate.

926
01:31:14.833 --> 01:31:16.708
We'll start soon. Don't miss anything.

927
01:31:16.791 --> 01:31:18.125
- Okay. - Yes.

928
01:31:19.250 --> 01:31:21.708
Yes, okay. I'll forward it later.

929
01:31:21.791 --> 01:31:23.833
- Ms. Fitri. - Yes?

930
01:31:23.916 --> 01:31:26.375
Your band Significant enters segment two after this.

931
01:31:26.458 --> 01:31:28.791
- Segment two? Thank you. - Yes.

932
01:31:30.208 --> 01:31:31.958
- Ms. Fitri. - Yes?

933
01:31:32.041 --> 01:31:34.083
Someone's looking for you.

934
01:31:34.166 --> 01:31:36.708
Are we on the same program as Ahmad Dhani?

935
01:31:36.791 --> 01:31:38.291
I don't think so.

936
01:31:38.375 --> 01:31:40.083
He's just a lookalike then.

937
01:31:40.166 --> 01:31:41.333
- Thank you. - Yes.

938
01:31:43.583 --> 01:31:46.416
- Can I help you? - You're Fitri, the manager of Significant?

939
01:31:46.500 --> 01:31:48.125
Yes, that's me. Can I help you?

940
01:31:48.208 --> 01:31:51.500
Can you come with us? Our boss would like to meet you.

941
01:31:51.583 --> 01:31:54.208
Could you tell me who your boss is?

942
01:32:24.500 --> 01:32:25.875
No!

943
01:32:26.958 --> 01:32:28.458
It's best not to unsheathe it.

944
01:32:32.625 --> 01:32:34.583
As I suspected.

945
01:32:35.791 --> 01:32:39.250
Yes, I know the consequences if it is unsheathed.

946
01:32:40.875 --> 01:32:42.583
Could you help us get into Saranjana?

947
01:32:47.833 --> 01:32:49.083
Why?

948
01:32:51.708 --> 01:32:53.291
Who are you really?

949
01:33:10.500 --> 01:33:13.125
Badri and Irus's marriage

950
01:33:15.500 --> 01:33:17.666
brought bad luck.

951
01:33:17.750 --> 01:33:19.750
I'm sorry, Saidah.

952
01:33:19.833 --> 01:33:21.458
Aren't you a bit harsh?

953
01:33:21.541 --> 01:33:23.458
No, I'm not!

954
01:33:23.541 --> 01:33:25.125
It's the truth.

955
01:33:26.875 --> 01:33:30.333
You and Utuh Ampong must be responsible for this.

956
01:33:41.583 --> 01:33:43.750
You idiot! What water is this?

957
01:33:43.833 --> 01:33:46.125
Water to clear your head with.

958
01:33:46.208 --> 01:33:48.000
So you can think about

959
01:33:48.083 --> 01:33:51.958
how much my sister must have suffered having a mother-in-law like you.

960
01:33:52.041 --> 01:33:54.625
- My jewelry! - Don't ever think I'll tell her to be okay

961
01:33:54.708 --> 01:33:56.000
with being the first wife.

962
01:33:57.208 --> 01:33:58.916
You're the brainless one!

963
01:34:28.375 --> 01:34:29.333
Come in.

964
01:34:33.666 --> 01:34:34.666
Sir.

965
01:34:40.000 --> 01:34:42.958
We have evidence that the trespassers entered through the halau-halau gates.

966
01:34:43.958 --> 01:34:47.208
It seems they used a mandau to unlock it.

967
01:35:13.875 --> 01:35:16.791
Welcome to Saranjana.

968
01:35:16.875 --> 01:35:21.500
SARANJANA
